{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey of transformation in <i>Farmer\u2019s Market Simulator</i>! After leaving your high-stress corporate job, you decide to follow your dream of building a peaceful life in the countryside. Take over your own farm, grow fresh produce, and manage every aspect of your business. But the story doesn\u2019t end at the fields\u2014run your very own market and sell your goods directly to your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this immersive farming and business management game, you\u2019ll plant crops, tend to animals, and carefully plan your production to maximize profits. Use your hard-earned skills to expand your market, upgrade your farm, and create the ultimate agricultural empire. Every decision counts\u2014what will you grow, and how will you thrive?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434210?t=1749561695","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434210?t=1749561695","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/95cd2b452ce72cd87dc238c0ac42f557f0a7072f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749561695","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/95cd2b452ce72cd87dc238c0ac42f557f0a7072f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749561695","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3800000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey of transformation in <i>Farmer\u2019s Market Simulator</i>! Aft